{"id":"95ad6b60be2b38da","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction.md","title":"Hadamard Distance and Two Query Recovery","display":"thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction — Hadamard Distance and Two Query Recovery","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction","aliases":["28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction"],"type":"theorem","display":"thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction — Hadamard Distance and Two Query Recovery","depends_on":["[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Claim 19.8; Theorem 19.18 and its proof","source_printed_pages":"382,388–389","source_pdf_pages":"408,414–415","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction — Hadamard Distance and Two Query Recovery"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47fb40251ca11590\" href=\"?note=47fb40251ca11590\" title=\"28-df-walsh-hadamard-code\">28-df-walsh-hadamard-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Claim 19.8; Theorem 19.18 and its proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"382,388–389"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"408,414–415"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,z,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a,b,z,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}\">\\(g\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in[n]\">\\(j\\in[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1/4)\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1/4)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma\">\\(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WH}_n,\\iota_n,\\odot,\\oplus\">\\(\\operatorname{WH}_n,\\iota_n,\\odot,\\oplus\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"47fb40251ca11590\" href=\"?note=47fb40251ca11590\" title=\"28-df-walsh-hadamard-code\">28-df-walsh-hadamard-code</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_{i=j}\">\\(\\mathbf1_{i=j}\\)</span> 是等式成立时为一、否则为零的标准示性值；下式概率以有限等势计数展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_j\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf1_{i=j}\\rangle_{i=1}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_j\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf1_{i=j}\\rangle_{i=1}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{g,z}(y)\\coloneqq\\left(g_{\\iota_n(y)}+g_{\\iota_n(y\\oplus z)}\\right)\\bmod2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{g,z}(y)\\coloneqq\\left(g_{\\iota_n(y)}+g_{\\iota_n(y\\oplus z)}\\right)\\bmod2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(\\operatorname{WH}_n(a),\\operatorname{WH}_n(b))=\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(\\operatorname{WH}_n(a),\\operatorname{WH}_n(b))=\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,2^n}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(\\operatorname{WH}_n;1/2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,2^n}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(\\operatorname{WH}_n;1/2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(g,\\operatorname{WH}_n(a))\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\n2^{-n}\\left|\\{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:D_{g,z}(y)=a\\odot z\\}\\right|\\ge1-2\\rho&gt;\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(g,\\operatorname{WH}_n(a))\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\n2^{-n}\\left|\\{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:D_{g,z}(y)=a\\odot z\\}\\right|\\ge1-2\\rho&gt;\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(g,\\operatorname{WH}_n(a))\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\n2^{-n}\\left|\\{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:D_{g,e_j}(y)=a_j\\}\\right|\\ge1-2\\rho&gt;\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(g,\\operatorname{WH}_n(a))\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\n2^{-n}\\left|\\{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:D_{g,e_j}(y)=a_j\\}\\right|\\ge1-2\\rho&gt;\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Claim 19.8（印刷382页/PDF408页）及 Theorem 19.18（印刷388–389页/PDF414–415页）的陈述与证明均已核对。源定理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3\">\\(2/3\\)</span> 成功概率通过重复放大取得；本节点精确记录一次两查询操作的原始保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-2\\rho\">\\(1-2\\rho\\)</span>，不把两查询误称为已达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3\">\\(2/3\\)</span> 的译码器。</p>\n<p>距离证明：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\ne b\">\\(a\\ne b\\)</span> 选一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\oplus b)_i=1\">\\((a\\oplus b)_i=1\\)</span> 的坐标。映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\mapsto y\\oplus e_i\">\\(y\\mapsto y\\oplus e_i\\)</span> 是无不动点对合，并将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\oplus b)\\odot y\">\\((a\\oplus b)\\odot y\\)</span> 的值翻转，所以恰有一半坐标不同。</p>\n<p>恢复证明：平移 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\mapsto y\\oplus z\">\\(y\\mapsto y\\oplus z\\)</span> 保持均匀分布，即使两个查询相关。两个位置各有至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 的出错比例，故并合界保证至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-2\\rho\">\\(1-2\\rho\\)</span> 的种子在两处均正确；此时由模二双线性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{g,z}(y)=a\\odot y+a\\odot(y\\oplus z)=a\\odot z\">\\(D_{g,z}(y)=a\\odot y+a\\odot(y\\oplus z)=a\\odot z\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=e_j\">\\(z=e_j\\)</span> 即恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_j\">\\(a_j\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=0^n\">\\(z=0^n\\)</span> 时两次查询同点且输出恒零，与结论相容。全体访问均由有限字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的显式坐标表达，没有新增隐含 oracle。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-walsh-hadamard-code","status":"resolved","id":"47fb40251ca11590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_m^\\Sigma$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]；$\\operatorname{WH}_n,\\iota_n,\\odot,\\oplus$ 见 [[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-walsh-hadamard-code","status":"resolved","id":"47fb40251ca11590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_m^\\Sigma$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]；$\\operatorname{WH}_n,\\iota_n,\\odot,\\oplus$ 见 [[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,z,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1/4)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WH}_n,\\iota_n,\\odot,\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_{i=j}","display":false},{"tex":"e_j\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathbf1_{i=j}\\rangle_{i=1}^n.","display":true},{"tex":"D_{g,z}(y)\\coloneqq\\left(g_{\\iota_n(y)}+g_{\\iota_n(y\\oplus z)}\\right)\\bmod2.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\ne b\\Longrightarrow\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(\\operatorname{WH}_n(a),\\operatorname{WH}_n(b))=\\frac12.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,2^n}^{\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1\\}}(\\operatorname{WH}_n;1/2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(g,\\operatorname{WH}_n(a))\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\n2^{-n}\\left|\\{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:D_{g,z}(y)=a\\odot z\\}\\right|\\ge1-2\\rho>\\frac12.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_{2^n}^{\\{0,1\\}}(g,\\operatorname{WH}_n(a))\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\n2^{-n}\\left|\\{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:D_{g,e_j}(y)=a_j\\}\\right|\\ge1-2\\rho>\\frac12.","display":true},{"tex":"2/3","display":false},{"tex":"1-2\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"2/3","display":false},{"tex":"a\\ne b","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\oplus b)_i=1","display":false},{"tex":"y\\mapsto y\\oplus e_i","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\oplus b)\\odot y","display":false},{"tex":"y\\mapsto y\\oplus z","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"1-2\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"D_{g,z}(y)=a\\odot y+a\\odot(y\\oplus z)=a\\odot z","display":false},{"tex":"z=e_j","display":false},{"tex":"a_j","display":false},{"tex":"z=0^n","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false}],"bytes":2683,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fb76a370ebde152b","47fb40251ca11590"]}